                                                "sense_id": "13317f7e-e38b-3663-9fdb-b76dd2268ac8",
                                                "text": "Six homosexualists (males?) thus far examined yielded from anatomically perfect testes an ovarian reaction in four instances and in the other two subjects (bisexualists), an ovario-testicular reaction (ovarian by measurement predominating)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb1cae42-ec50-4340-b84f-96cd79d6fa30",
                                                "sense_id": "13317f7e-e38b-3663-9fdb-b76dd2268ac8",
                                                "text": "[…] roughly speaking, a homosexualist is born and not made."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7c0833a-fa40-4156-bdf3-604adacc2a44",
                                                "sense_id": "13317f7e-e38b-3663-9fdb-b76dd2268ac8",
                                                "text": "They have got fairly liberal laws on victimless crimes, but the Los Angeles police are still busy entrapping homosexualists because the police chief in Los Angeles is very antifag."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca4c6deb-90e1-40bd-9fbb-cf531694c603",
                                                "sense_id": "13317f7e-e38b-3663-9fdb-b76dd2268ac8",
                                                "text": "[…] and how the homosexualist cause is rooted squarely in the secular/pagan view of the cosmos."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "715e5e26-a59d-4c0e-b606-3be2ed77ffa5",
                                                "sense_id": "13317f7e-e38b-3663-9fdb-b76dd2268ac8",
                                                "text": "Fundamentally, unconsciously, I believe he's a homosexualist."
                                            }
                                        ]
